resent, and client.css defines no tag sizing to collide with it - so this closes a divergence rather than fixing a visible defect; LinkedDataHub is the consumer that puts the language tag at the xs size. Verified byte-equality rather than a line count: all four stylesheets are now identical both to the kit and to LinkedDataHub's vendored copies, braces balance in each, and no ldhc- string is reintroduced.","ai_tool":"Claude"}]